    Bug 1817769 - Try to fix intermittent comm/calendar/test/browser/timezones/browser_timezones.js. r=aleca,freaktechnik


    There was plenty of misuse of popup events in this helper: for popup events it's best to use BrowserTestUtils.waitForPopupEvent(popup, "shown") and BrowserTestUtils.waitForPopupEvent(popup, "hidden");
    as they will check the popup state interally so you do not have to set up a listener before the event may happen. I found many places in this file using plain event listeners, and clicking before the waiting had been set up, so the event is easily missed.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D244966

